SUMMARY:DNA & Dead Ends: Cracking Family Mysteries
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261024T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261024T140000
UID:91fcda2c9c8f684194220c0537b2a695@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Presentation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nDNA doesn't lie!Eric Schube
 rt will share real-life past examples from his work as a professional gene
 alogist and forensic genetic genealogist which includes long-lost family d
 iscoveries and historic cold case breakthroughs. Attendees will learn prac
 tical strategies for starting or advancing their own research\, from recor
 d paper trails to working with DNA matches. This program will offer a narr
 ative of Eric’s research journey\, as well as clear\, accessible guidanc
 e for beginners and those with specific genealogical questions. These tips
  are inspired by experience solving complex cases for thousands across the
  country!Ages 18+Space is limited · Registration is required
LOCATION:Lancaster\, LPL Board Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/dna-dead-ends-cracking-f
 amily-mysteries-180888
