UID:307cdf709e2b3d02e567eb06936d2344@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Presentation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nOn November 3\,
  Lancaster County voters will decide whether to enact a countywide Library
  tax.There is a lot of misinformation circulating about the proposed Libra
 ry tax. At this information session\, you’ll receive accurate informatio
 n about the proposed Library tax\, including what it means for library ser
 vices\, taxes\, and more. Each of the four events will present the same in
 formation.📅 Saturday\, October 17 at 10AM📅 Thursday\, October 22 at 
 6PM📅 Monday\, October 26 at 12PM📅 Friday\, October 30 at 9:30AMAddit
 ionally\, we will host three information sessions at the Mountville Branch
 .📅 Friday\, October 16 at 10:30AM📅 Saturday\, October 24 at 12PM📅
  Thursday\, October 29 at 6PM
