UID:08dcfb5ce1be481c70818362cfb01ab6@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Children\n\nNotice: This week\, we’ll explore th
 e letter G for Ghost in honor of Halloween! Children are welcome to wear t
 heir Halloween costumes to the library for some extra spooky fun.Designed 
 to spark curiosity and a love for learning in young children\, this progra
 m features stories\, songs\, and hands-on activities tailored for preschoo
 l-aged kids. Each session focuses on building early literacy\, motor skill
 s\, and social interaction through playful exploration.Perfect for ages 3
 –6 with an adult\, this program provides a welcoming and inclusive envir
 onment where kids can learn and grow together. Parents and caregivers are 
 encouraged to participate and share in the joy of discovery with their lit
 tle ones.Adults attending with their child(ren) do NOT need to register. P
 lease add any additional registrants to your registration if more than one
  child that will be participating in the program.Registration will open at
  9:00AM on Wednesday\, September 16th for Manheim Township and East Lampet
 er residents and on Friday\, September 18th for residents of other municip
 alities.Storytime PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing to cancel their regi
 stration for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted fr
 om registering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Ple
 ase cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the p
 rogram to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their chan
 ge in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior
  to the start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances.
  The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, yo
 ur spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted en
 try. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. Howeve
 r\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past 
 the start time.Accompanying Adults – This program is for adults and chil
 dren to enjoy together. Please plan to attend and be engaged with your chi
 ld. Drop offs will not be permitted.Cancellations- Please check your email
  prior to departing to verify that the program has not been cancelled.Prog
 ram Limits - Patrons are limited to one session of multiple session progra
 ms per week.Preschool Party Registration Requirements – All children who
  will be participating in the craft will need to be registered as a partic
 ipant to allow for adequate supplies.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/preschool-party-169531
