DESCRIPTION:Community\, Presentation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nThe sirens soun
 d\, the news breaks\, and there’s a zombie at the door... 🚨🧟‍♂
 ️ What’s your next move?!Survive the Outbreak: Zombie Emergency Prepar
 edness! ⚡Think you have what it takes to survive the undead? Join Fire C
 hief Scott Little & the Lancaster County Emergency Management Service to t
 est your wits against a zombie apocalypse while mastering real-world emerg
 ency skills! Learn how a trusty flashlight protects you from lurking walke
 rs and sudden power outages\, build the ultimate disaster go-bag for horde
 s or hurricanes\, and master off-grid communication. Gear up for interacti
 ve survival scenarios and leave with an airtight plan to keep your family 
 safe no matter what strikes! Registration is Encouraged
