UID:6079b0d790423e9382c2bccab0dec451@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, Teens\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nIf you enjoy craft
 ing and conversations\, this class is for you! For September\, October - a
 nd maybe November\, they will be joining in on the TikTok viral trend of c
 ompleting a Chaos Blanket\, where the results of the project will be nothi
 ng short of a surprise. Supplies/What to Bring: Choose 5 colors - assign e
 ach color a number 1-5 and keep record of the number assigned to the color
 . You will need to reference this throughout the project. Ex: red - 1\, bl
 ue - 2\, pink - 3\, etc. - this is part of the chaos fun!Hook - based on r
 ecommended size for yard being used (H/5mm\, I/5.5MM typically works for m
 ost projects and yarn weight)Recommend worsted weight or light/sport wrigh
 t yarn if making for babyScissorsStitch MarkersYarn NeedleSee right hand s
 ide of screen for printable PDF of materials and more information. This pr
 oject is for experienced crocheters. Participants are also welcome to brin
 g their own project to work on.
LOCATION:Columbia\, COL Meeting Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/crochet-kasey-chaos-blan
 ket-200096
