 prior to departing to verify that the program has not been cancelled.Progr
 am Limits - Patrons are limited to one session of multiple session program
 s per week.Preschool Party Registration Requirements – All children who 
 will be participating in the craft will need to be registered as a partici
 pant to allow for adequate supplies.
