UID:0662ab1fc97da29b74f86aa0a68424df@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Presentation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nOn November 3\,
  Lancaster County voters will decide whether to enact a countywide Library
  tax.There is a lot of misinformation circulating about the proposed Libra
 ry tax. At this information session\, you’ll receive accurate informatio
 n about the proposed Library tax\, including what it means for library ser
 vices\, taxes\, and more. Each of the three events will present the same i
 nformation.📅 Friday\, October 16 at 10:30AM📅 Saturday\, October 24 a
 t 12PM📅 Thursday\, October 29 at 6PMAdditionally\, we will host four in
 formation sessions at the Lancaster City Branch.📅 Saturday\, October 17
  at 10AM📅 Thursday\, October 22 at 6PM📅 Monday\, October 26 at 12PM
 📅 Friday\, October 30 at 9:30AM
LOCATION:Mountville Branch
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/vote-yes-libraries-just-
 facts-206534
