 articipants will be accommodated on a first-come\, first-served basis with
 in that wave. Please arrive early to allow for parking. This system ensure
 s everyone has a chance to join the fun while keeping the trail safe and o
 rganized. Important Details:Registration is required. Please register each
  child attending—do not register adults.Suggested ages: 1–8 yearsOne W
 ave Only: To give as many families as possible a chance to participate\, e
 ach child may register for one wave only.Get ready for a fun\, festive adv
 enture—don’t forget your costume!Registration will open at 9am on Wedn
 esday October 14th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on
  Friday\, October 16th for residents of other municipalities. Storytime Po
 licies:No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more t
 han 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from registering for 
 future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your reg
 istrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for
  those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registration 
 status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of th
 e program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will b
 egin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be for
 feited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remai
 n\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants wil
 l not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Acco
 mpanying Adults – This program is for adults and children to enjoy toget
 her. Please plan to attend and be engaged with your child. Drop offs will 
 not be permitted.Cancellations- Please check your email prior to departing
  to verify that the program has not been cancelled.
LOCATION:Manheim Township
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/story-time-trick-or-trea
 t-trail-wave-7-and-8-202936
