DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Art Song Society Presents \n\nChanticleer\, the Grammy® Award-winning vocal ensemble is known worldwide as “an orchestra of voices” for its dazzling virtuosity and richly diverse repertoire. Founded in San Francisco in 1978\, Chanticleer has become one of the world’s most acclaimed touring and recording ensembles. They will present a program titled Our American Journey\, celebrating America’s 250th anniversary. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
