DESCRIPTION:Community\, Discussion\, Presentation\, Tweens\, Teens\, Adult
 s\, Seniors\n\nUncover Lancaster County’s Hidden History!Did you know No
 vember is Native American Heritage Month? Right here in Lancaster County\,
  archaeologists have been digging into our dirt—and what they’ve uncov
 ered is seriously cool!Join us for a special presentation with Lancaster C
 ounty Parks as we step back in time to explore the incredible history\, ar
 tifacts\, and stories of the people who walked this land long before us.Co
 me find out what the locals really had going on centuries ago. Bring your 
 curiosity—you won't look at our county the same way again! 🔍 Archeolo
 gy lovers and history buffs welcome!
LOCATION:Manheim Community
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/people-pennsylvanias-pas
 t-207269
