DESCRIPTION:Community\, Discussion\, Health & Wellness\, Adults\, Seniors\
 n\nGet your rolling pins ready! This month\, Cooks & Books is getting a he
 ad start on the festive season by focusing on baking techniques to help le
 vel up your holiday spread.To inspire your baking\, we’re drawing from t
 wo fantastic resources:Billy Parisi’s Website: Perfect for those who lov
 e detailed\, chef-driven techniques and classic methods.Chasing Flavors by
  Dan Kluger: A deep dive into how flavor profiles work to make your bakes 
 truly stand out.Bonus Special Event: We’ll also be hosting a Baking Tool
 s & Equipment Swap! Bring any new or gently used kitchen gadgets\, tools\,
  or baking supplies (like rolling pins\, specialty pans\, or decorative sp
 rinkles) you'd like to trade with fellow home cooks.Cooks & Books is a wel
 coming space for anyone who loves food and cooking. Bring a dish inspired 
