DESCRIPTION:STEM\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens\n\nAppropriate for all ages!.
  Please register everyone in your group. Animal bones\, especially skulls 
 can be extremely useful in determining facts about an animal’s preferenc
 es for food.  Teeth and beaks are great clues for the diet of wildlife.  E
 verybody says “gross” when we talk about scat\, but animal poop is a v
 aluable tool of biologists.  It can be used to discover much information a
 bout an animal.  Up close and hands on examination of skulls\, bones and s
 cat is fascinating.
