BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancasterbirdclub": "https://lancasterbirdclub.org/event/conewago-rec-trail-field-trip/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancasterbirdclub
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Bird Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T103000
DTSTAMP:20260914T165240Z
CREATED:20240407T074902Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260914T165240Z
UID:1539-1794124800-1794133800@lancasterbirdclub.org
SUMMARY:Conewago Rec Trail Field Trip
DESCRIPTION:Carl Groff will lead this easy walking field trip west along the trail with a stop at the Hershey Trust Wetlands overlook\, and then continue west with views of open fields\, woodland\, and creeks. The walk will be out and back\, probably a distance of 2-3 miles\, depending on the wishes of the group. You may turn around at any time to go back to the parking lot. Note: You can no longer park along Rt. 743. From Lancaster take Rt. 283 west to the Elizabethtown Rt. 743 exit. Turn right onto Rt. 743 towards Hershey. Go about 1/4 mile and turn right on Beverly Road. A parking area for the Conewago Trail is on the left side of the road at Old Trolley Line Park. There is a porta-john in the parking lot.  Meet Carl at 8 a.m. in the parking lot and bring water and snacks. Contact Carl at (717-471-9969 or fledge19@verizon.net) by 6 p.m. the day before if you have questions or would like to attend. \nMeeting Location: Old Trolley Line Park\, 475 Beverly Rd.\, Elizabethtown\, PA 17022 \nContact: Carl Groff (717) 471-9969 or fledge19@verizon.net
URL:https://lancasterbirdclub.org/event/conewago-rec-trail-field-trip/
LOCATION:Old Trolley Line Park (Meetup Location)\, 475 Beverly Rd.\, Elizabethtown\, PA\, 17022\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lancasterbirdclub.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/IMG_0573.jpeg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Apostlesucc": "https://apostlesucc.org/event/where-welcome-grows-celebrating-one-year-of-ona/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:apostlesucc
X-SOURCE:Church of the Apostles UCC
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T140000
DTSTAMP:20261024T003232
CREATED:20261007T161716Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007T161938Z
UID:38726-1794137400-1794146400@apostlesucc.org
SUMMARY:Where Welcome Grows: Celebrating One Year of ONA
DESCRIPTION:🎉 Come celebrate a year of wider welcome at COA! \nOn Sunday\, November 8 at 11:30 AM\, we’re celebrating with an afternoon of music\, magic\, art\, food\, and community as we reflect on how welcome continues to grow. 💚 \n🎶 Bobbi Carmitchell will kick things off with music at 11:35 AM\n✨ Victor Capece brings the magic at 12:15 PM\n🎸 Deklan Lewis will close out the performances with music at 1 PM \nAnd there’s more! 🎨 We’ll invite the community to add their own touch to the art piece started at Lancaster Pride before we finish it and hang it in our building as a lasting reminder of the welcome we share. \nCome grab some food\, enjoy the performances\, make some art\, and celebrate a year of wider welcome! 🌈🌿 \n📍 1850 Marietta Ave.\, Lancaster
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/where-welcome-grows-celebrating-one-year-of-ona/
LOCATION:Church of the Apostles UCC\, 1850 Marietta Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://apostlesucc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Inclusive-Church-Year-of-Welcome-Celebration-Nov.-8th.jpg
END:VEVENT
