UID:e2057460a957e603248de4c1f2f6a075@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Business & Career\, Adults\n\nWhy Inclusion is Good Business w
 ith Jane HoranMost leaders believe their team is inclusive\, but their tea
 m often see it differently. Drawing on case studies and coaching stories f
 rom Coaching Inclusion\, this talk makes the business case for inclusion i
 n plain terms: better decisions\, stronger retention\, and helping leaders
  access the full range of expertise in the room. The book and talk reframe
  inclusion as a daily leadership practice\, and participants experience on
 e of the key elements of inclusion through a short listening and questioni
 ng exercise developed through years of coaching leaders across industries 
 and cultures.Walk-ins welcome Ages 18+
LOCATION:Lancaster\, LPL Board Room
