UID:fff32d6c2bf6d30b35f0ee1b33de95ff@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\, Tweens\n\nMeet Author Greg P
 izzoli!Join us at the library for a special visit with award-winning autho
 r and illustrator Greg Pizzoli! He is the creator of many beloved children
 ’s books\, including The Watermelon Seed\, Good Night Owl\, The Book Hog
 \, Number One Sam\, and the hilarious Baloney and Friends graphic novel se
 ries. Children will have the opportunity to meet Greg\, learn about his wo
 rk as an author and illustrator\, and discover the creativity behind bring
 ing stories to life.Don’t miss this exciting opportunity to meet a favor
 ite author and celebrate a love of reading!Registration Note: To make room
  for as many children as possible\, please limit registration to 1–2 adu
 lts per family. Thank you for helping us make this special experience avai
 lable to more young readers! You must register every person attending\, in
 cluding adults and children\, to ensure we stay within room capacity.Regis
 tration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, October 21st for Manheim Townsh
 ip and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, November 4th for residen
 ts of other municipalities.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes 
 prior to the start of the program to allow for parking and other circums
 tances. The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At this ti
 me\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be gra
 nted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program.
  However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 mi
 nutes past the start time.
