  Historical Foundation on November 14th for their Annual Meeting! After a 
 few brief items of business\, LHF President Cory Van Brookhoven will prese
 nt on the history of Rocky Springs Park.Beginning in the late 1800s\, Rock
 y Springs Park was an extremely popular amusement resort in Lancaster\, Pe
 nnsylvania. Learn the fascinating history of this beloved place as well as
  the many factors that eventually led to its downfall.
