LAST-MODIFIED:20261012T195721Z
UID:10000453-1794740400-1794754800@zestchef.com
SUMMARY:2855 - Zest Cooking School Open House
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we celebrate the grand opening of our new Zest Cooking School at Shops at Rockvale! We’re opening our doors to the community for a fun-filled afternoon of food\, cooking\, and connection. \nCome explore our beautiful new kitchen\, meet our talented Chef Instructors and Culinary Assistants\, and experience what makes Zest Cooking School so special. Throughout the afternoon\, we’ll be hosting live cooking demonstrations\, including fresh pasta making\, knife skills\, baking techniques and a kids cooking station. Sample delicious homemade treats\, enjoy coffee\, hot chocolate and cider\, have giveaways from Zest! store and discover our upcoming lineup of hands-on cooking classes. \nBring a gently loved cookbook to participate in our Community Cookbook Swap and leave with a new culinary treasure to inspire your next meal. \nLearn about private events\, kids’ camps\, and adult cooking classes\, and meet the chefs who make every class an unforgettable experience. \nWhether you’re a longtime guest or visiting us for the first time\, we invite you to stop by\, sample something delicious\, meet our team\, and celebrate the beginning of an exciting new chapter for Zest Cooking School. We can’t wait to welcome you into our kitchen! \n  \n*This is a free event
URL:https://zestchef.com/class/2855-open-house-and-grand-opening/
LOCATION:Zest Cooking School\, 35 S. Willowdale drive\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://zestchef.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Chocolate-Baking-Class-at-Zest-Cooking-School-e1791827261824.png
END:VEVENT
