 at are keeping readers up at night. Come for the scares\, stay for the sur
 vival strategies.June 15 - How to Sell a Haunted House by Grady Hendrix Ju
 ly 20 - My Heart is a Chainsaw by Stephen Grahm Jones August 17 - Bad Cree
  by Jessica Johns September 21 - We Used to Live Here by Marcus KliewerOct
 ober 19 - The Last House on Needless Street by Catriona Ward November 16 -
