 e interested in science and the work of a scientist. The presentation will
  feature an Albertosaurs skull. They will highlight the features of this c
 arnivore and examine the characteristics of this dinosaur. Audience member
 s will experience the thrill of digging up a real Triceratops dinosaur bon
 e and then help construct a dinosaur on a large cut-out. Audience particip
 ation\, a touch of magic\, and show & tell with rare fossils will round ou
 t this fun\, educational\, and exciting adventure!As an added attraction\,
  Mike and Roberta will set-up a mini museum\, showcasing photos and minera
 ls from their summer digs in South Dakota. Program is best suited for ages
  4+.Limit 60 children. Please register each child individually.Adults atte
