 ears old! This engaging program will introduce young learners to the impor
 tance of healthy eating through hands-on activities and simple\, nutritiou
 s recipes.Guided by GIANT’s registered dietitian\, Miss Charlotte\, chil
 dren will explore fresh ingredients\, learn how to make balanced food choi
 ces\, and create delicious\, easy-to-make snacks.  Program Highlights:✅ 
 Hands-on recipe demonstrations with kid-friendly ingredients✅ Nutrition 
