DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T140000
UID:757c8b997deececca4ada52237378319@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Finance\, Presentation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nHoste
 d in partnership with the Office of State Rep. Nikki Rivera\, AARP Pennsyl
 vania\, and the PA Department of Banking and Securities\, this interactive
  $CAM JAM is designed to help you safeguard your money and identity.As sca
 mmers become more technologically savvy\, staying educated is the best way
  to protect yourself and your loved ones from financial fraud and abuse.Wh
 at to ExpectExpert Presentation: Learn practical tips from the PA Departme
 nt of Banking on how to spot and avoid common scams.Fraud BINGO: Play a fu
 n\, interactive game of Fraud BINGO for a chance to win prizes!Light Refre
 shments: Complimentary snacks and drinks will be served.Registration Requi
 redSpace is limited! Register today to reserve your seat!For more informat
 ion\, please contact the Office of State Rep. Nikki Rivera at:📞 Phone: 
 717-295-3157📧 Email: RepRivera@pahouse.net
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center BC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/cam-jam-173923
