UID:d4b784bd8566820c8bc613d0262db4ad@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Babies\n\nBusy BabiesA Baby & Caregiver Class for Ages 6–17 
 MonthsCome sing\, play\, and grow together! Busy Babies is a playful\, han
 ds-on class designed for babies ages 6–17 months and their caregivers. E
 ach class gives little ones opportunities to explore\, move\, discover\, a
 nd socialize while caregivers learn simple ways to support early developme
 nt through everyday play.Classes feature monthly themes\, songs and finger
 plays\, interactive activities\, sensory exploration\, movement\, books\, 
 and socialization. Babies can practice important early skills such as comm
 unication\, coordination\, problem-solving\, imitation\, and social-emotio
 nal development—all while having fun alongside their grownup and new fri
 ends.What We’ll Do TogetherEach month introduces a fun new theme with ac
 tivities that encourage babies to:🎵 Sing & move with songs\, fingerplay
 s\, and movement games📚 Read & explore age-appropriate books\, puppets\
 , and story props🖐️ Touch & discover through sensory and hands-on act
 ivities🧸 Play & learn with simple activities that encourage curiosity a
 nd problem-solving💕 Connect & socialize with caregivers and other babie
 s🚼 Move & grow through crawling\, cruising\, dancing\, reaching\, and o
 ther age-appropriate movement👀 Look\, listen & communicate through play
 ful interactions\, gestures\, sounds\, and early language activities
LOCATION:Strasburg-Heisler
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/busy-babies-play-learn-g
 row-babies-ages-6-month-17-months-caregiver-206944
