X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/family-story-time-169944"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:CANCELLED: Family Story Time
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261128T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261128T103000
UID:65f47a1d87411232762762cb74e6cea9@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nBring the whole family to t
 he library for a delightful storytime experience! Perfect for children age
 s 0-12\, this program features engaging stories\, lively songs\, and fun a
 ctivities designed to spark a love of reading and learning. This is a wond
 erful opportunity for families to bond\, build literacy skills\, and creat
 e lasting memories together!Adults attending with their child(ren) do NOT 
 need to register. Please add any additional registrants to your registrati
 on if more than one child that will be participating in the program.Regist
 ration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, November 11th for Manheim Townsh
 ip and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, November 13th for residents
  of other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing to 
 cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs in a month will
  be restricted from registering for future programs for a period of one mo
 nth’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to t
 he start of the program to allow for those on the waiting list to be notif
 ied of their change in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive
  10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parking and oth
 er circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated time. 
 At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who w
 ill be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into th
 e program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the progra
 m 5 minutes past the start time.Accompanying Adults – This program is fo
 r adults and children to enjoy together. Please plan to attend and be enga
 ged with your child. Drop offs will not be permitted.Cancellations- Please
  check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has not be
 en cancelled.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/family-story-time-169944
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
