 be provided. Please register for each session you are able to attend.   Th
 e goal of this club will be to develop lifelong reading habits\, learn tip
 s on getting the most out of your library\, and accepting a genre challeng
 e. Teens seeking leadership service hours may contact Sharon Roche for det
 ails. Please bring a book you are currently reading to each meeting. We wi
 ll meet alternate Thursdays during the summer except where noted on the ev
 ent calendar. Attendees can advocate for additions to our teen collection\
 , program requests\, and more!
