 s all elements of the Elastic technology stack\, from beginning to expert.
 \n* Meet others who have been using Elastic for a long time\, or installin
 g for the very first time.\n* Conceive of new and unexpected ways to explo
 it the powers of Elastic tech!\n\nAgenda\n\n* 6:00 PM - Doors open with fo
 od\, networking\, and refreshments\n* 6:30 PM - Elastic News and Tech AMA\
 n* 7:00 PM - Speaker Presentation\n* 7:30 PM - Q&A and Community Time
